+{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"282785":{"pageid":282785,"ns":0,"title":"Patch 5.1.0/API changes","revisions":[{"revid":2736212,"parentid":2736206,"timestamp":"2013-01-06T16:37:16Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{apichanges|5.1.0|prev=5.0.4|next=5.2.0}}\n\n== New features ==\n; Loss of control UI : Notifies the player when their character is affected by crowd control, interrupt, and spell lockout effects.\n; Instance-based chat channels : Separate chat channels for battleground/instance groups.\n; Pet Journal API updates : Pets are now identified using GUIDs (several functions renamed to this effect); added functions to translate a pet name to a pet GUID, and functions and slash commands to summon a random pet: /randompet and /randomfavoritepet.\n\n'''Miscellaneous'''\n* {{api|UnitIsBattlePet}} and {{api|UnitBattlePetSpeciesID}} added, and can be used to identify battle pets.\n* Additional functions are now available within the [[RestrictedEnvironment]]:\n** {{api|HasVehicleActionBar}}\n** {{api|HasOverrideActionBar}}\n** {{api|HasTempShapeshiftActionBar}}\n** {{api|HasOverrideUI}}\n** {{api|GetVehicleBarIndex}}\n** {{api|GetOverrideBarIndex}}\n** {{api|HasExtraActionBar}}\n** {{api|GetTempShapeshiftBarIndex}}\n** {{api|CanExitVehicle}}\n* The {{api|t=w|Cooldown:SetCooldown}} function now automatically shows/hides the Cooldown widget when the cooldown animation is active and when it completes.\n\n== Automated diff ==\nClick on the headers to expand the tables below.\n\n{{:Patch 5.1.0/API changes/diff}}"}}}]}}}}
